  "title": "Reynolds Consumer Products Declares Regular Quarterly Cash Dividend",
  "summary": "LAKE FOREST, Ill. --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Apr. 30, 2026-- Reynolds Consumer Products Inc. (Nasdaq: REYN) announced today that its Board of Directors has declared a quarterly cash dividend of $0.23 per common share. The dividend is payable May 29, 2026, to shareholders of record as of May 15, 2026.",
